    "optionLayout": "vertical",
    "rawText": "For the exothermic industrial Haber synthesis of ammonia: N₂(g) + 3H₂(g) ⇌ 2NH₃(g), ΔH = -92.4 kJ/mol, which conditions favor maximum ammonia yield?",
    "content": [
      {
        "id": "p-chem-1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "runs": [
          { "id": "t-c-1", "text": "For the exothermic industrial Haber synthesis of ammonia:" }
